rs and 3,000 RU/s. The use-your-own-resources page says 3 to 5 containers per project at 1,000 RU/s each, depending on the runtime\n(classic: thread-message-store, system-thread-message-store, agent-entity-store; Responses API adds agent-definitions-v1 and run-state-v1). The account needs at least 3,000 RU/s; too little\nRU/s fails provisioning.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"One passage says five containers; another says three containers and 3,000 RU/s. The use-your-own-resources page says 3 to 5 containers per project at 1,000 RU/s each, depending on the runtime\n(classic: thread-message-store, system-thread-message-store, agent-entity-store; Responses API adds agent-definitions-v1 and run-state-v1). The account needs at least 3,000 RU/s; too little\nRU/s fails provisioning.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"24Wz0AZC6tWkMZoK_4nL0","type":"text","x":1662.0,"y":6350.5,"width":291.58,"height":15.0,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1971c2","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["upRXCyMpu9pxBZxCf0jHj"],"frameId":null,"index":"bEF","roundness":null,"seed":1367885033,"version":2,"versionNonce":133134623,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1793750400000,"link":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/agents/how-to/use-your-own-resources","locked":false,"fontSize":12,"fontFamily":5,"text":"Learn: Use your own resources with Agent Service","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Learn: Use your own resources with Agent Service","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"l_Lfe0-8PknUciC3-YHJZ","type":"text","x":1662.0,"y":6367.5,"width":167.98,"height":15.0,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1971c2","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["upRXCyMpu9pxBZxCf0jHj"],"frameId":null,"index":"bEG","roundne